\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ueqR02mtOXAQ7kNvwFWG5VJ&_nc_oc=Admgz6RFbjSBvyMtTat1raVh3PIQbY5duwCUskDHPXhblh4pqHOili8UQxlnyRfq7qY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy3p179WuQumkLCB0fhPEC0U7IMaQcov0aAUx4IwWv-AA&oe=69B544F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R3_MHlOCz30Q7kNvwEuRTzp&_nc_oc=AdkYXU-KPVeLDPDnwlcaZvTxlidqmi9kOP8T0B4_Y3ijX7JwQDQn7aCtS7uy3Hze32A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzZBMR-22tvtCRvGIgo9f0N7nnZi9GSjM_dAmaTpATaNQ&oe=69B54656"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RpuHjxVTmfoQ7kNvwEJcuC2&_nc_oc=AdmKtKuADfio0Te8dPqxW0MOfcpiVkqtCyAnYOb98rpp72V_1-5pHDDSJxiCV4cEZck&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwNdH8sFgDaqg6kapz945sCi5kS0wE5DgKUTczrDYo-Lg&oe=69B55B77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771